lassName\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"\\\"yes\\\"\"}]}],\" yang menandakan bahwa bisa akses. Sesuaikan pada bagian opsi \",[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-1\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":\"\\\"-n \\\"\"}]}],\" atau namespace nya, karena pasti berbeda beda.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"pre-0\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl overflow-x-auto bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/10 my-6 w-full shadow-lg\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 bg-surface-container-high border-b border-outline-variant/10 min-w-max\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-label text-[0.6875rem] text-outline uppercase tracking-widest\",\"children\":\"bash\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-error/40\"}],\"$L47\",\"$L48\"]}]]}],\"$L49\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n33:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"h4-9\",{\"children\":\"8. Pengujian Kube-Agent dan GitLab-Runner\"}]\n34:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-13\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"Pengujian menjalankan pipeline sederhana untuk mengecek Pod yang ada dengan script gitlab-ci seperti berikut.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"pre-0\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl overflow-x-auto bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/10 my-6 w-full shadow-lg\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 bg-surface-container-high border-b border-outline-variant/10 min-w-max\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-label text-[0.6875rem] text-outline uppercase tracking-widest\",\"children\":\"yaml\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-error/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary/40\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"pre\",null,{\"className\":\"p-6 text-sm font-mono text-primary-fixed/80 leading-relaxed w-full min-w-max whitespace-pre\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"className\":\"language-yaml\",\"children\":\"deploy:\\n  stage: deploy\\n  image: bitnami/kubectl\\n  script:\\n    - kubectl get pods -n gitlab-agent-test\\n  tags: <tags_pada_runner>\\n\"}]}]]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Seperti ini nanti jika sudah berhasil menjalankan pipelinenya.\\n\",[\"$\",\"img\",\"img-0\",{\"src\":\"/assets/images/kube-agent/hasil-pengujian.png\",\"alt\":\"name img\"}]]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n35:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"h4-10\",{\"children\":\"Kesimpulan\"}]\n36:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-8\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"Integrasi GitLab Kube Agent dengan KAS membawa angin segar bagi pengguna Kubernetes yang menginginkan fleksibilitas tanpa mengorbankan keamanan. Dengan kemampuannya mengelola kluster dalam jaringan terisolasi, melakukan sinkronisasi konfigurasi secara real-time, serta mendukung skenario GitOps yang kompleks, tools ini menegaskan komitmen GitLab dalam menyediakan solusi end-to-end untuk siklus hidup pengembangan perangkat lunak.\"}]\n37:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-9\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"Penting untuk diingat bahwa adopsi teknologi cloud-native tidak hanya tentang menggunakan tools terbaru, tetapi juga tentang memilih solusi yang selaras dengan kebutuhan keamanan dan operasional tim. GitLab Kube Agent dan KAS adalah contoh nyata bagaimana kolaborasi antara platform CI/CD dan Kubernetes bisa menghasilkan efisiensi yang lebih baik. Bagi Anda yang belum mencoba, kini saatnya untuk bereksperimen dan melihat bagaimana kombinasi ini dapat mentransformasi alur DevOps di organisasi Anda.\"}]\n38:[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full py-12 mt-20 bg-[#1a1c1e]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto gap-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col items-center md:items-start gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-headline font-bold text-[#5ED0D3] text-xl\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L10\",null,{\"href\":\"/\",\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-white font-headline\",\"children\":\"NAJWAN\"}]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-sm tracking-wide text-gray-500\",\"children\":[\"© \",2026,\" Najwan. All rights reserved.\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",\"WhatsApp\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-sm tracking-wide text-gray-500 hover:text-[#5ED0D3] transition-colors relative group\",\"href\":\"https://wa.me/62895414361074\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"children\":[\"WhatsApp\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute bottom-[-2px] left-1/2 w-0 h-[1px] bg-[#5ED0D3] transition-all group-hover:w-full group-hover:left-0\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Email\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-sm tracking-wide text-gray-500 hover:text-[#5ED0D3] transition-colors relative group\",\"href\":\"mailto:najwanoctavian@gmail.com\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"Email\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute bottom-[-2px] left-1/2 w-0 h-[1px] bg-[#5ED0D3] transition-all group-hover:w-full group-hover:left-0\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"GitHub\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-sm tracking-wide text-gray-500 hover:text-[#5ED0D3] transition-colors relative group\",\"href\":\"https://github.com/vianAja\",\"target\":\"_b