lusi yang selaras dengan kebutuhan keamanan dan operasional tim. GitLab Kube Agent dan KAS adalah contoh nyata bagaimana kolaborasi antara platform CI/CD dan Kubernetes bisa menghasilkan efisiensi yang lebih baik. Bagi Anda yang belum mencoba, kini saatnya untuk bereksperimen dan melihat bagaimana kombinasi ini dapat mentransformasi alur DevOps di organisasi Anda.\"}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full py-12 mt-20 bg-[#1a1c1e]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto gap-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col items-center md:items-start gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-headline font-bold text-[#5ED0D3] text-xl\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/\",\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-white font-headline\",\"children\":\"NAJWAN\"}]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-sm tracking-wide text-gray-500\",\"children\":[\"© \",2026,\" Najwan. All rights reserved.\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",\"WhatsApp\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-sm tracking-wide text-gray-500 hover:text-[#5ED0D3] transition-colors relative group\",\"href\":\"https://wa.me/62895414361074\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"children\":[\"WhatsApp\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute bottom-[-2px] left-1/2 w-0 h-[1px] bg-[#5ED0D3] transition-all group-hover:w-full group-hover:left-0\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Email\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-sm tracking-wide text-gray-500 hover:text-[#5ED0D3] transition-colors relative group\",\"href\":\"mailto:najwanoctavian@gmail.com\",\"children\":[\"Email\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute bottom-[-2px] left-1/2 w-0 h-[1px] bg-[#5ED0D3] transition-all group-hover:w-full group-hover:left-0\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"GitHub\",{\"className\":\"font-body text